<section class="py-5 bg-light">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h2 class="fw-bold">Frequently Asked Questions for Photographers</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq1">
                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse1">
                        What information should I include on a photography invoice?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        A photography invoice should include your business name/logo, client name and contact details, shoot date and location, a clear description of services (e.g., "2-hour portrait session + 20 edited digital images"), package price, any add-ons (prints, albums, travel fees), deposit amount paid, remaining balance due, and payment terms (due date, accepted methods).
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq2">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse2">
                        Is this photography invoice generator really free?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes! RatPDF's invoice generator is completely free for photographers. There are no hidden fees, subscriptions, or watermarks. You can create unlimited invoices and download them as PDF files at no cost.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq3">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse3">
                        Can I add a deposit or retainer to the invoice?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Absolutely. You can enter a deposit amount paid by the client, and the invoice will automatically calculate the remaining balance. This is perfect for wedding photography retainers or session deposits.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq4">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse4">
                        Can I use this for wedding photography invoices?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes, the generator works perfectly for wedding photography. You can include package details (e.g., "8-hour coverage + second shooter + online gallery"), travel fees, album costs, and deposit tracking – everything a wedding photographer needs.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq5">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse5">
                        Do I need to create an account to generate invoices?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        No account or sign-up is required. You can start creating invoices immediately, and we don't store any of your data. Your privacy is protected.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

